Z||000002||Uaana||01-17-2001||12:16 PM||||I found an online company where you submit an email request. They got back to me in less than a day with a quote. <A HREF="http://www.tirenet.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.tirenet.com/</A> <BR>Or you can call them at. 1-888-261-9566.<BR>The $60 price was for 215/60/15's so 17's will probably be more. no quote on shipping though.<BR>hope this helps<p>[This message has been edited by Uaana (edited 01-17-2001).]||||reg||1
